        <item>
            <title>Version 1.1.1</title>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Mika+Grid 1.1.1</h2>
                <p>Bug fix release — snapping is now reliable on the first trigger.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Snap applies position <em>and</em> size in a single trigger — previously only the size landed and the action had to be repeated, most noticeably in Chrome, VS Code, Slack and other Chromium/Electron apps</li>
                    <li>Halves and quarters now tile without a seam on scaled displays and notch Macs</li>
                    <li>The menu bar no longer freezes when a target app stops responding</li>
                    <li>Clicking a zone in the popover no longer targets Mika+Grid itself</li>
                    <li>Changing a shortcut in Preferences no longer makes one keypress fire repeatedly and break Restore</li>
                    <li>Removed the non-functional "Enable snap animations" setting</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
